{
  "cheap_closure_possible": true,
  "env_or_log_hooks": [
    "logger.debug(\"Auto-compaction threshold decision\", {...}) — pi-coding-agent/src/session/session-maintenance.ts:2128-2147 — the per-turn threshold evaluation record (shouldCompact, thresholdTokens, resolvedContextTokens, methods). CAVEAT: it sits AFTER the compaction.enabled gate (:2086-2088), so a disabled run produces NO line — it is negative evidence only; the control run supplies the positive \"threshold crossed, would have fired\" line.",
    "Log sink: rotating file ~/.omp/logs/omp.<pid>.log, file ON / console OFF by default (pi-utils/src/logger.ts:241-256 makeFileTransport, :265-267 transportOpts {file:true}, :277-285 emitLocally writes debug unconditionally — no level filter; getLogsDir pi-utils/src/dirs.ts:587-589).",
    "OMP_COMPACTION_TRACE / OMP_COMPACTION_TRACE_OFF / OMP_COMPACTION_PAYLOAD — pi-agent-core/src/compaction/compaction.ts:987-1018 — append-only JSONL per EXECUTED compaction (default on, ~/.omp/agent/compaction-trace.log). Zero entries in the gate run corroborates \"nothing fired\"; one entry in the control run proves the harness crosses the threshold.",
    "No PI_*/OMP_* env var forces a compaction check or lowers the threshold — grep over pi-coding-agent/src + pi-agent-core/src found only the trace vars above, PI_TOKENIZER_ACCURATE (pi-agent-core/src/tokenizer.ts:10), PI_DEBUG_STARTUP / PI_TIMING (pi-utils/src/logger.ts:366, :396), OMP_AUTH_BROKER_* (auth-broker-config.ts:60).",
    "UI corroboration: with compaction.enabled=false the threshold boundaries resolve to null (pi-coding-agent/src/modes/utils/context-usage.ts:69-80) — the status line shows no compaction marker in the gate run."
  ],
  "gate_set": [
    {
      "bypasses_enabled_flag": false,
      "location": "pi-coding-agent/src/session/session-maintenance.ts:2086-2088 (checkCompaction, post-turn threshold)",
      "setting_or_condition": "!compaction.enabled || methodOrder empty → COMPACTION_CHECK_NONE. Primary gate for the Case-4 threshold path (:2126-2163)."
    },
    {
      "bypasses_enabled_flag": true,
      "location": "pi-coding-agent/src/session/session-maintenance.ts:3049-3051 (runAutoCompaction master gate)",
      "setting_or_condition": "reason !== \"idle\" && !compaction.enabled → return none. The \"idle\" reason EXEMPTS itself from the enabled check — idle compaction bypasses compaction.enabled entirely."
    },
    {
      "bypasses_enabled_flag": true,
      "location": "pi-coding-agent/src/modes/controllers/event-controller.ts:2300-2321 → session-maintenance.ts:1229-1231 (idle chain)",
      "setting_or_condition": "Idle trigger armed only when compaction.idleEnabled=true (default false, settings-schema.ts:2653-2655) AND context ≥ compaction.idleThresholdTokens (default 200000, :2664-2666) AND editor idle; timeout = clamp(idleTimeoutSeconds, 60..3600) (default 300, :2686-2688). Fires runIdleCompaction → runAutoCompaction(\"idle\") which skips the enabled gate."
    },
    {
      "bypasses_enabled_flag": true,
      "location": "pi-coding-agent/src/session/session-maintenance.ts:~2082-2085 before the :2086 gate (#pruneStaleToolResults, defined :508-560)",
      "setting_or_condition": "CONFIRMED ASYMMETRY: the stale-result supersede prune runs BEFORE the compaction.enabled gate, gated only by compaction.supersedeReads / compaction.dropUseless (:509-510; both default true, settings-schema.ts:2705-2707 and :2716-2718). It performs a real history rewrite via sessionManager.rewriteEntries() (:552) when it prunes. NOT compaction, but IS an automatic history rewrite independent of enabled."
    },
    {
      "bypasses_enabled_flag": false,
      "location": "pi-coding-agent/src/session/session-maintenance.ts:1935-1940 (overflow recovery in checkCompaction)",
      "setting_or_condition": "compaction.enabled && hasConfiguredCompactionMethod → runRecoveryCompactionWithRollback(\"overflow\") (turn-recovery.ts:1029-1044 → runAutoCompaction). With enabled=false the overflow path emits only a payload/usage dead-end notice (:1941-1949), no compaction. Context PROMOTION is tried first (:1926) but is gated by contextPromotion.enabled (default false, settings-schema.ts:2494-2497) and switches model rather than rewriting history."
    },
    {
      "bypasses_enabled_flag": false,
      "location": "pi-coding-agent/src/session/session-maintenance.ts:2035-2036, :2067-2071 (incomplete / length-stop recovery)",
      "setting_or_condition": "compaction.enabled && hasConfiguredCompactionMethod → runRecoveryCompactionWithRollback(\"incomplete\"). Gated; promotion tried first under contextPromotion.enabled (:2019-2028)."
    },
    {
      "bypasses_enabled_flag": false,
      "location": "pi-coding-agent/src/session/session-maintenance.ts:1738-1745 (maintainContextMidRun, mid-turn)",
      "setting_or_condition": "!compaction.enabled || no methods || compaction.midTurnEnabled === false → return. midTurnEnabled is an additional independent gate (default true, settings-schema.ts:2533-2535)."
    },
    {
      "bypasses_enabled_flag": false,
      "location": "pi-coding-agent/src/session/session-maintenance.ts:1650-1710 (runPrePromptCompactionIfNeeded)",
      "setting_or_condition": "Gated via shouldCompact() — pi-agent-core/src/compaction/compaction.ts:348-352 checks settings.enabled first. No separate enabled read needed."
    },
    {
      "bypasses_enabled_flag": false,
      "location": "pi-coding-agent/src/session/session-maintenance.ts:1287-1289 (maybeStartSpeculativeCompaction) and :1347-1350 (deferThresholdCompactionToSpeculation), :1508-1510 (claim)",
      "setting_or_condition": "!compaction.enabled || compaction.asyncEnabled === false || no methods. asyncEnabled is a second independent gate (default true, settings-schema.ts:2626-2628)."
    },
    {
      "bypasses_enabled_flag": false,
      "location": "pi-coding-agent/src/session/session-advisors.ts:1595-1598 (#maintainAdvisorContext)",
      "setting_or_condition": "!compaction.enabled || methodOrder empty → no advisor compaction."
    },
    {
      "bypasses_enabled_flag": false,
      "location": "pi-agent-core/src/compaction/compaction.ts:348-352 (shouldCompact) and :373-397 (resolveThresholdTokens)",
      "setting_or_condition": "Engine gate: !settings.enabled || settings.strategy === \"off\" → false. Note \"off\" is unreachable from settings: there is NO compaction.strategy settings key (grep of settings-schema.ts = no match); strategy is injected per-method at compaction-methods.ts:96-99."
    },
    {
      "bypasses_enabled_flag": false,
      "location": "pi-coding-agent/src/session/session-maintenance.ts:2093 + :465-494 (#pruneToolOutputs)",
      "setting_or_condition": "Per-turn dropUseless prune runs AFTER the enabled gate (called at :2093, past :2086-2088), so with enabled=false it never runs. Gated by compaction.dropUseless (:473)."
    }
  ],
  "irreducibly_expensive_part": "Nothing for the gate itself — compaction.thresholdTokens=400 makes the threshold trivially crossable, so S1.2 does NOT need a hundreds-of-thousands-token session. Two paths are not cheaply exercisable but do not need to be: (a) provider-overflow recovery requires the provider itself to return an overflow error (AIError.isContextOverflow against a ~1M-token request); (b) length-stop recovery requires a real response.incomplete. Both are code-cited as gated (:1935-1940, :2035-2036) and funnel into runAutoCompaction, whose non-idle branches honor enabled=false. The idle bypass is empirically reachable cheaply (idleEnabled=true + thresholdTokens=400 + ≥60s idle, per the 60s clamp) but the code citation suffices since the default is off. Residual wording for the evidence file: with enabled=false, 'no automatic COMPACTION fires' holds except the idle path (pin idleEnabled=false); 'no automatic history REWRITE' additionally requires pinning supersedeReads/dropUseless=false because the supersede prune precedes the gate.",
  "recipe": "S1.2 / GATE 0.2a CAN be closed cheaply. (1) Sandbox settings: compaction.enabled=false, compaction.thresholdTokens=400, compaction.idleEnabled=false (pin explicitly — default false, but the idle path bypasses the enabled gate), compaction.supersedeReads=false + compaction.dropUseless=false (neutralize the pre-gate prune asymmetry so 'no history rewrite' is clean), contextPromotion.enabled left at default false. (2) CONTROL run: identical settings except compaction.enabled=true; a 2-3 turn session (fixture read + short reply) crosses the 400-token threshold → expect the 'Auto-compaction threshold decision' log with shouldCompact:true (session-maintenance.ts:2128), a CompactionEntry in the session file, and one OMP_COMPACTION_TRACE line — proves the harness genuinely crosses the threshold. (3) GATE run: compaction.enabled=false, same tiny turns → expect NO threshold-decision log (early return at :2086-2088 precedes it), NO CompactionEntry, NO trace line, session file unchanged. The A/B pair isolates the flag: same shouldCompact-true condition, only compaction.enabled differs. (4) Record residuals in the evidence file: idle path structurally bypasses the flag (:3049-3050) — closed by pinning idleEnabled=false and citing; supersede prune runs pre-gate — closed by pinning supersedeReads/dropUseless=false and citing :509-510/:552; overflow/incomplete recovery paths are code-cited as gated (:1935-1940, :2035-2036) and cannot be triggered by settings — acceptable because the gate question is whether enabled=false stops automatic compaction, and every entry point is gated at its source.",
  "threshold_setting": "YES — compaction.thresholdTokens (pi-coding-agent/src/config/settings-schema.ts:2583-2585; type number, default -1 = auto). Read by resolveThresholdTokens (pi-agent-core/src/compaction/compaction.ts:373-379): any finite value >0 WINS over thresholdPercent and is clamped only to [1, contextWindow-1] (:376-378). Setting 400 (or even 1) puts the threshold at 400 tokens on hyper/qwen3.8-flash's 1,000,000 window — a two-turn session crosses it. Secondary lever: compaction.thresholdPercent (settings-schema.ts:2558-2560, default -1, clamped to [1,99] at compaction.ts:395) — 1% of 1M = 10,000 tokens, too coarse. Default path when both are -1: contextWindow − resolveBudgetReserveTokens (compaction.ts:388-394; reserve = max(15% of window, reserveTokens ?? default), :318-320 and :334-345). Both keys are plain settings.yml entries — no env var or host patch needed."
}

